  "description": {
    "en": "Grapplesnake Paradox Pro is a next-generation tour string built with advanced metallic performance additives and proprietary manufacturing processes. It combines direct feel, outstanding precision, long-lasting playability and excellent comfort in a round-profile string with a mildly abrasive surface. Unlike traditional polyester strings, it requires almost no break-in period and maintains its playing characteristics until it finally breaks.",

    "zh": "Grapplesnake Paradox Pro 是一款采用先进金属添加剂与特殊制造工艺打造的新一代竞技球线。它拥有极其直接的击球反馈、优秀的精准控制、长时间保持性能的能力以及出色的舒适性。虽然采用圆形截面，但依靠微磨砂表面依然能够提供优秀的旋转表现。与传统聚酯不同，它几乎无需磨合，并能在整个使用寿命内保持稳定性能，直到断线为止。"
  },

